{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:29 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:29 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:29 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"事發於石埗村。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/cc4278d455342cf26074767d23b2604f/2026-11/page_138.jpg\"/><p>元朗發生工業意外。今日（16日）早上10時25分，一名53歲姓石釘板男工人在洪水橋石埗村一工地工作，其間他使用風車鋸切割渠筒，詎料意外鋸到自己大腿，不斷淌血。工友見石男血流如注，大驚下連忙報警。現場是石埗東路，救護員趕到，幸發現石男清醒，將他送往屯門醫院救治。警方列作工業意外，調查事件。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.120198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:29:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:48:10.212245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:46.936842+00:00","content_hash":"39ec238ba93bdc80b5533d73ca010dde6a6a227e5fd9573ce9476a906a636c9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}